{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35842","headline":"赠友弟 · 李咸用","name":"赠友弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萤焰烧心雪眼劳，未逢佳梦见三刀。\n他时讵有盐梅味，今日犹疑腹背毛。\n金埒晓羇千里骏，玉轮寒养一枝高。\n谁能终岁摇頳尾，唯唯洋洋向碧涛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}